    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50357" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱλέομαι</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱλεόομαι</span></b> 
